#: ../../source/guide/gui.md e7d897dc3b3e4dc297c641451ac4d910
msgid "「项目」/「轨道库」页签 + 语言切换 + 项目树或过滤栏"
msgstr "\"Project\" / \"Catalog\" tabs + language switcher + project tree or filter bar"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md ef8b105c796349338b8d23dc3580a061
msgid "浏览产物、查库"
msgstr "Browse products, query the library"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md 15fbbb4c7d8444539d5744244c5884d5
msgid "中栏"
msgstr "Middle"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md 84b78ecb9ed94eeea678ebd7703c2715
msgid "「轨道族生成」参数面板 + 生成按钮"
msgstr "\"Orbit Family Generation\" parameter panel + Generate button"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md 3872336408f74b5c8c01944dced40ac3
msgid "发起计算"
msgstr "Start computations"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md 7924f75e5136499e9d78b7da5de78536
msgid "右栏"
msgstr "Right"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md b2ef92a56d444451a4f9123be2b44f64
msgid "Three.js 画布 + 浮动按钮 + 状态行"
msgstr "Three.js canvas + floating buttons + status line"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md 5af30b71a4d74049bb7d13ca1af4153b
msgid "呈现结果"
msgstr "Present results"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:13 bc6334b793f0415780704b5ee7f876e5
msgid "左栏右上角的下拉在中 / EN 之间切换界面语言，选择持久化（localStorage）， 重启后保留。"
msgstr "The dropdown at the top of the left column switches the interface language between Chinese and English; the choice persists (localStorage) across restarts."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:16 f13974a5f97c464f8dfeb454bcae2a16
msgid "左栏：项目与轨道库"
msgstr "Left Column: Project and Catalog"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:18 cc414038362f4ed2affe6018916032ea
msgid "**项目页签**列出当前会话生成的产物（族生成完成后自动出现）。"
msgstr "The **Project tab** lists products generated in the current session (a family appears automatically once generation completes)."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:20 ab6d6c5fcbce40a9a31ec29d93f0bea3
msgid ""
"**轨道库页签**打开即查询全库（空过滤条件），结果显示在下方项目树；过滤栏复用 参数面板的自动表单机制，支持按族类型、平动点、Jacobi "
"区间、振幅区间与标签 组合筛选，改完点「查询」。"
msgstr "The **Catalog tab** queries the whole library on open (empty filter); results show in the project tree below. The filter bar reuses the parameter panel's auto-form mechanism and supports combined filtering by family type, libration point, Jacobi range, amplitude range and tags — adjust and click \"Query\"."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:24 ab828f2580dc42e6a7cef5a418ed62ef
msgid "点击树中任一族记录，画布叠加该族全部成员的轨迹（经 `catalog_get` 懒加载）。"
msgstr "Clicking a family record in the tree overlays all its member trajectories on the canvas (lazy-loaded via `catalog_get`)."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:26 5681fee8a4d845f0a0cfa278352d2ad5
msgid "中栏：参数面板"
msgstr "Middle Column: Parameter Panel"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:28 0bb2c5b8303e45ddb85182513eebc757
msgid ""
"面板由工具的 JSON Schema 自动生成：构建期 `tools/export_tool_schemas.py` 从 e2m2e 的 "
"Pydantic 模型导出 schema 到 `frontend/src/toolSchemas/`，前端按 schema "
"渲染字段——数值框、下拉、勾选（对应模型的 Optional 语义：勾选即传值， 不勾不传）。按 `orbit_type` "
"只显示当前族适用的字段，跨族字段不出现在表单里。"
msgstr "The panel is generated from the tool's JSON Schema: at build time `tools/export_tool_schemas.py` exports schemas from e2m2e's Pydantic models into `frontend/src/toolSchemas/`, and the frontend renders fields from the schema — number boxes, dropdowns, checkboxes (mapping the models' Optional semantics: checked means the value is sent, unchecked means unset). Only fields applicable to the current `orbit_type` are shown; cross-family fields never appear in the form."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:33 15453fa0b53a42c98ef71cf48ca88c30
msgid "运行期间「生成」按钮变为禁用态；左下角状态行滚动显示 sidecar 进度消息。"
msgstr "While running, the \"Generate\" button is disabled; the status line at the bottom left scrolls sidecar progress messages."

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:35 87e047a1795e43dc8d3620dbedea9c5e
msgid "画布区"
msgstr "Canvas Area"

#: ../../source/guide/gui.md:37 6fe6de3dc8eb437b8654d1111f578042
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"详见 {doc}`visualization`。右上角三个浮动按钮：**适配**（按轨迹包围盒复位 视角）、**导出动画**（录制 8 秒自转 "
"webm）、**图表设置**（轨道线宽、天体与 平动点标注大小与颜色、Z 轴比例，localStorage 持久化，可恢复默认）。左下角 "
"状态行显示运行进度与当前画布内容统计（族成员数 / 库轨迹数）。"
msgstr "See {doc}`visualization`. Three floating buttons at the top right: **Fit** (recentre on the trajectory bounding box), **Export Animation** (record an 8-second auto-rotating webm), **Chart Settings** (orbit line width, body and libration-point marker size and color, Z-axis ratio; persisted in localStorage, resettable). The status line at the bottom left shows run progress and current canvas contents (family members / catalog trajectories)."

